/-!
# Unconditional requested-time replay source

This version reuses the established whole-space-time residual inventory and
support-refinement grammar, but constructs every finite Galerkin stage from
the unconditional kinetic common-time theorem.  The source therefore no
longer requires an initial half-critical non-crossing witness.

The actual lineage, viscosity, and positive requested interval generate the
initial stage and every successor.  Trajectories, support refinements,
residual witnesses, and response branches remain conclusion data.
-/

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace NavierStokes
namespace
    ThreeDimensionalVorticityCoefficientGeneratedShellGluingResidualNativeMacroRequestedTimeReplayV2Source

open Set
open SourceGeneratedNativeResponseDisposition
open ThreeDimensionalPeriodicCoarseFilterCore
